2026-11-07T06:49:28.4217080Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4217500Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4236730Z 
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4236920Z I will:
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4237060Z 
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4237600Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4238090Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4238580Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4238980Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4239280Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4239580Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4239990Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4240360Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4259290Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4259910Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4285360Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4286260Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4286630Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4287090Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4287420Z 
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4287630Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-07T06:49:28.4287930Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
